414+  82A3 29               ADD HL, HL
415+  82A4 29               ADD HL, HL
416+  82A5 01 00 3C         LD BC, $3C00
417+  82A8 09               ADD HL, BC
418+  82A9
419+  82A9 16 40            LD D, $40
420+  82AB 06 08            LD B, 8
