116+  836D              ; ProcessEntities - Loop principal per-entity
117+  836D              ; ==============================================================================
118+  836D              ; Para cada entidad activa: erase → update → draw
119+  836D              ; ==============================================================================
120+  836D              ProcessEntities:
121+  836D DD 21 37 80      LD IX, EntityTable
122+  8371 06 11            LD B, NUM_ENTITIES
